    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decay Breath\u00a0is\u00a0an\u00a0immersive\u00a0VR\u00a0survival\u00a0shooter\u00a0that\u00a0takes\u00a0you\u00a0into\u00a0a\u00a0post-apocalyptic\u00a0world\u00a0filled\u00a0with\u00a0zombie\u00a0figures.\u00a0Three\u00a0years\u00a0after\u00a0the\u00a0outbreak\u00a0of\u00a0the\u00a0disaster,\u00a0you\u00a0will\u00a0wake\u00a0up\u00a0from\u00a0the\u00a0incubator\u00a0and\u00a0face\u00a0a\u00a0ruined\u00a0world.\u00a0As\u00a0a\u00a0survivor,\u00a0you\u00a0must\u00a0rely\u00a0on\u00a0your\u00a0wits\u00a0to\u00a0survive\u00a0in\u00a0this\u00a0dangerous\u00a0world\u00a0and\u00a0uncover\u00a0the\u00a0truth\u00a0about\u00a0the\u00a0world's\u00a0past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game\u00a0Characteristics\u00a0\uff1a</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hard\u00a0gun\u00a0assembly\u00a0and\u00a0shooting</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic\u00a0gun\u00a0assembly\u00a0system,\u00a0players\u00a0can\u00a0disassemble\u00a0and\u00a0assemble\u00a0magazines,\u00a0magnifiers,\u00a0sights\u00a0and\u00a0manually\u00a0stuff\u00a0bullets.\u00a0Personally\u00a0adjust\u00a0weapon\u00a0parts\u00a0and\u00a0assemble\u00a0your\u00a0firearms,\u00a0enjoy\u00a0every\u00a0moment\u00a0of\u00a0pleasure\u00a0from\u00a0precision\u00a0shooting.\u00a0Use\u00a0customized\u00a0weapons\u00a0to\u00a0accurately\u00a0shoot\u00a0heads\u00a0or\u00a0sever\u00a0limbs\u00a0to\u00a0repel\u00a0the\u00a0surging\u00a0zombie\u00a0army.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736390/extras/d558c48d37bf8eeee08484a76c728ad0.poster.avif?t=1752944066\" width=470 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736390/extras/d558c48d37bf8eeee08484a76c728ad0.webm?t=1752944066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736390/extras/d558c48d37bf8eeee08484a76c728ad0.mp4?t=1752944066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich\u00a0Melee\u00a0System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The\u00a0game\u00a0offers\u00a0a\u00a0variety\u00a0of\u00a0melee\u00a0weapons,\u00a0such\u00a0as\u00a0knives,\u00a0swords,\u00a0hammers,\u00a0axes,\u00a0etc.\u00a0You\u00a0can\u00a0use\u00a0these\u00a0weapons\u00a0to\u00a0dismember\u00a0the\u00a0zombies\u00a0and\u00a0experience\u00a0the\u00a0real\u00a0battle\u00a0feeling.\u00a0In\u00a0addition,\u00a0you\u00a0can\u00a0also\u00a0use\u00a0temporary\u00a0items\u00a0in\u00a0the\u00a0environment\u00a0to\u00a0attack,\u00a0such\u00a0as\u00a0stones,\u00a0bricks,\u00a0glass\u00a0bottles,\u00a0trash\u00a0can\u00a0lids\u00a0and\u00a0so\u00a0on.\u00a0Every\u00a0prop\u00a0and\u00a0weapon\u00a0can\u00a0be\u00a0a\u00a0sharp\u00a0weapon\u00a0for\u00a0you\u00a0to\u00a0fight\u00a0with\u00a0the\u00a0zombies,\u00a0allowing\u00a0you\u00a0to\u00a0experience\u00a0a\u00a0creative\u00a0combat\u00a0and\u00a0survival\u00a0feeling\u00a0like\u00a0never\u00a0before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736390/extras/3538e48b57dc1308d22e2deb9c3b6b69.poster.avif?t=1752944066\" width=450 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736390/extras/3538e48b57dc1308d22e2deb9c3b6b69.webm?t=1752944066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736390/extras/3538e48b57dc1308d22e2deb9c3b6b69.mp4?t=1752944066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Highly\u00a0Interactive\u00a0Physics\u00a0Engine</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The\u00a0immersive\u00a0physics\u00a0interaction\u00a0system\u00a0allows\u00a0you\u00a0to\u00a0freely\u00a0open\u00a0doors,\u00a0grab\u00a0props,\u00a0climb\u00a0obstacles,\u00a0zipline\u00a0across\u00a0and\u00a0more.\u00a0You\u00a0can\u00a0also\u00a0use\u00a0a\u00a0hanging\u00a0ring\u00a0to\u00a0cross\u00a0a\u00a0bridge\u00a0or\u00a0directly\u00a0 hit \u00a0a\u00a0zombie\u00a0with\u00a0your\u00a0fists.\u00a0Each\u00a0action\u00a0will\u00a0directly\u00a0affect\u00a0your\u00a0survival\u00a0and\u00a0combat\u00a0strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736390/extras/1372153e2dc61e65b5d6b01d8fff019d.poster.avif?t=1752944066\" width=524 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736390/extras/1372153e2dc61e65b5d6b01d8fff019d.webm?t=1752944066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736390/extras/1372153e2dc61e65b5d6b01d8fff019d.mp4?t=1752944066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay\uff1a</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Group\u00a0Episode\u00a0Mode.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team\u00a0up\u00a0with\u00a0a\u00a0friend\u00a0and\u00a0explore\u00a0the\u00a0post-apocalyptic\u00a0world\u00a0cooperatively\u00a0in\u00a0a\u00a0heart-wrenching\u00a0storyline\u00a0adventure!\u00a0You\u00a0will\u00a0face\u00a0unknown\u00a0challenges,\u00a0unlock\u00a0hidden\u00a0secrets,\u00a0live\u00a0and\u00a0die\u00a0together,\u00a0and\u00a0experience\u00a0the\u00a0true\u00a0feeling\u00a0of\u00a0apocalyptic\u00a0survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless\u00a0Corpse\u00a0Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge\u00a0the\u00a0endless\u00a0tide\u00a0of\u00a0zombies\u00a0with\u00a0your\u00a0teammates.\u00a0Each\u00a0challenge\u00a0is\u00a0tougher\u00a0than\u00a0the\u00a0last,\u00a0who\u00a0can\u00a0last\u00a0until\u00a0the\u00a0end\u00a0in\u00a0this\u00a0life\u00a0and\u00a0death\u00a0test\uff1f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In\u00a0Breath\u00a0of\u00a0Decay\u00a0you\u00a0will\u00a0experience:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fine\u00a0gun\u00a0assembly\u00a0and\u00a0operation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The\u00a0feeling\u00a0of\u00a0dismembering\u00a0zombies\u00a0with\u00a0melee\u00a0weapons\u00a0such\u00a0as\u00a0knives,\u00a0hammers,\u00a0axes,\u00a0etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creative\u00a0ways\u00a0to\u00a0fight\u00a0with\u00a0zombies\u00a0using\u00a0props\u00a0around\u00a0you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive\u00a0physical\u00a0and\u00a0environmental\u00a0interactions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight\u00a0alongside\u00a0your\u00a0friends\u00a0against\u00a0the\u00a0endless\u00a0tide\u00a0of\u00a0zombies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ready\u00a0for\u00a0the\u00a0challenge?\u00a0The\u00a0fate\u00a0of\u00a0the\u00a0post-apocalyptic\u00a0world\u00a0is\u00a0in\u00a0your\u00a0hands.</strong></p>",
